<view class="page"><view class="eyebrow">PRACTICE WITH PURPOSE</view><view class="heading">让练习，更有针对性</view><view class="subtitle">从薄弱知识点出发，每次多掌握一点。</view><view class="card" style="margin-top:30rpx"><view class="label">01 · 练习模式</view><view class="choices"><view class="choice {{source === 'generated' ? 'selected' : ''}}" data-field="source" data-value="generated" bindtap="choose">✧ 知识变式</view><view class="choice {{source === 'mistakes' ? 'selected' : ''}}" data-field="source" data-value="mistakes" bindtap="choose">▤ 错题重练</view></view><view class="label">02 · 选择学科</view><picker range="{{subjects}}" data-field="subject" data-range="subjects" bindchange="classify"><view class="form-picker">{{subject}} ⌄</view></picker><view class="form-columns"><view><view class="label">年级（错题重练）</view><picker range="{{grades}}" data-field="gradeFilter" data-range="grades" bindchange="classify"><view class="form-picker">{{gradeFilter}} ⌄</view></picker></view><view><view class="label">题型（错题重练）</view><picker range="{{questionTypes}}" data-field="typeFilter" data-range="questionTypes" bindchange="classify"><view class="form-picker">{{typeFilter}} ⌄</view></picker></view></view><view class="label">03 · 练习难度</view><view class="choices"><view wx:for="{{difficulties}}" wx:key="*this" class="choice {{difficulty === item ? 'selected' : ''}}" data-field="difficulty" data-value="{{item}}" bindtap="choose">{{item}}</view></view><view class="row"><view class="label">04 · 题目数量</view><text class="section-link">{{count}} 道</text></view><slider min="1" max="20" step="1" value="{{count}}" activeColor="#7f9a66" backgroundColor="#e7eddd" block-color="#285440" block-size="22" bindchange="count"/><view class="row subtitle"><text>1 道 · 轻松热身</text><text>20 道 · 全力以赴</text></view><view class="tip">预计用时 {{count * 2}} 分钟。先独立思考，再查看解析。{{source === 'mistakes' ? '符合条件的错题不足时，按实际数量出题。' : ''}}</view><button class="primary submit" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy}}" bindtap="generate">生成专属练习 →</button></view><view class="subtitle">数学、物理支持规则数值变式；英语、语文使用精选题库，可能抽到重复题目。登录后，答错的新题会自动收入错题本。</view></view>
